  "construction_notes": [
    {
      "text": "Townhomes in three-story buildings on the northern half; apartments in three 6/7-story buildings on the southern side",
      "src": [
        "SRC-000925"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "708 apartments in three buildings and 139 townhomes in 21 townhouse buildings; vesting tentative map creates 26 lots",
      "src": [
        "SRC-000926"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "County parcel owners of record: 035-242-140 (666 Concar Dr) 666 CD Corporation; 035-242-190 (690 Concar Dr) 690 CD Corporation and Concar Ranch & Enterprises Inc; 035-242-210 (640 Concar Dr) CFT C San Mateo LLC, Concar Enterprises Inc lessee; 035-242-170 (1880 S Grant St) 1880 SG Corporation; 035-242-160 (1855 S Delaware St) 1855 SD Corporation; 035-242-090 (678 Concar Dr) a family trust, c/o Southland Corporation; 035-242-220 (1801 S Delaware St) Smith B Properties LLC; 035-242-200 (1820 S Grant St) 1820 SG Corporation. Most list Woodmont Real Estate Services as care-of.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001103"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "City page: a prior project on the site was approved by the City Council in September 2020 with 961 units, about 40,000 sq ft of commercial space, 73 affordable units and 3 acres of community open space. Current plan is 59 units per acre.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-000925"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Townhome building count: the city page shows 16 three-story townhome buildings; the CEQA Notice of Exemption shows 21 townhouse buildings (139 units).",
      "src": [
        "SRC-000925",
        "SRC-000926"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "SF YIMBY: unit total reduced from 869 to 847 in the updated proposal; a relocated 7-Eleven at Concar Drive and Grant Street is the only new commercial space; the Trader Joe's building is retained.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-002040"
      ]
    }
